[9.742073, "o", "\u001b[2m  \"\"\"order-sync: apply the orders from the sales system to the inventory.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  Meant to run on a schedule (see README.md)::\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m      python job.py                 # read the CSV export\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m      python job.py --source api    # ask the sales API instead\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  Exit code 0 means the sync finished; anything else means it could not run.\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \"\"\"\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  \u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  import argparse\u001b[0m\r\n\u001b[2m  import logging\u001b[0m\r\n"]
